One day, after P.E., as Sugiura was heading back to the classroom, she heard a voice from somewhere.
A faint, thin voice that sounded like it was calling for help.
She immediately went looking for whoever it was.{p}

rows.37:7c04:
The voice seemed to come from the back of the gym, from the gym storeroom.
"I didn't hear anything when I put the balls away just now..."
Muttering that, she went toward the voice.{p}

rows.37:7efc:
That's right.
She tried to go get them some water.
The closest place from there was the drinking fountains beside the gym.{p}

rows.37:8144:
Maybe because they were so thin, both children were very light.
So she reached the fountains in no time.
And then...☆{p}

